# Cleaning up the inbox: gi zooms to INBOX, items go out one by one with gm (each move zooms to the destination, H comes back), the rest go together, then the empty INBOX is deleted and gi says so.
file <<END
Work:
	- Email Sarah
Personal:
	- Gym
INBOX: @inbox
	- Buy printer paper
	- Book dentist
	- Idea: blog about outliners
	- Reply to landlord
END
keys gi
see 󰋜 › INBOX
see ▌   - Buy printer paper
keys j gm
see Move to
type work
keys <Enter>
see 󰋜 › Work
see ▌   - Book dentist
keys H
see 󰋜 › INBOX
keys j j gm
type pers
keys <Enter>
see ▌   - Reply to landlord
keys gi <C-a> gm
type work
keys <Enter>
see ▌   - Idea: blog about outliners
keys gi
see ▌ INBOX:
keys , dd
hide INBOX
keys gi
status No inbox project: use Select Inbox Project
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Email Sarah
	- Book dentist
	- Buy printer paper
	- Idea: blog about outliners
Personal:
	- Gym
	- Reply to landlord
END
